doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24485965  # all versions; each release has a DOI of its own on Zenodo
abstract: >-
  A five-view window model for echocardiography video (PLAX, PSAX, A4C, A5C, SC4C), a change-point decoder that cuts
  a stream of recordings into views, and the code to evaluate and train them on the public EV9V dataset.
